[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Uhgg... what happened...
[color=yellow]Random Gnome[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/Buff_O, next=10] HALT! What are you doing in the Gnome Kings land??! Explain yourself human!
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] W...What are you talking about- Gnome king? Why am I so small?
[color=yellow]Random Gnome[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/Buff_O, next=10] Enough! You’re coming with me to meet the king himself!
=> END


~ teleportToGnomeKing
#add lines
[color=red]The King Of Gnomes[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/king, next=10] -And who have you brought me this time, Gnome 1? Another snack?
[color=yellow]Random Gnome[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/Buff_O, next=10] Something like that, I wouldn’t be opposed to seeing you eat such insolence.
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Hold on, wait! I can be friend! Don’t eat me, I taste like sadness and financial troubles!
[color=red]The King Of Gnomes[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/king, next=10] ...hmm... I could use another errand boy to do my tasks.... Tell you what, kid, I have a few tasks that I really should be doing, but since you showed up, perfect time to delegate them!
[color=red]The King Of Gnomes[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/king, next=10] I hear that the Mushroom farmer, Bloogargth needed my help for something, but I am unsure what... come back to me, after you helped him out!
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Alright...

