~ backToKingAfterShrooms
[color=red]The King Of Gnomes[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/king, next=10] Human! I heard from my minions that you managed to help my mushroom farmer! Thank you!
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Yeah, of course, what’s next?
[color=red]The King Of Gnomes[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/king, next=10] Now, my next task for you is to help my other Gnome minion, Bleafus find my lost items around the yard! After you do that, there is one more task I need you to do!
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] On it!
=> END


~ rouletteGnomeGiveQuest
#add both voicelines
[color=blue]Bloogargth[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/Bloogargth, next=10] Gahh! Why do you look like that?!
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Rude. I’m here on behalf of the Gnome King, you asked for his help with something?
[color=blue]Bloogargth[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/Bloogargth, next=10] ...well yes I did... but do you think you can really help?
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Come on, I can at least try, what do you need help with?
[color=blue]Bloogargth[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/Bloogargth, next=10] so... I might've gotten my Food mushrooms with my Fun mushrooms, and I need a little help finding the Food ones, I’m starving...
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] sigh... I really don’t have another choice...

=> END 

