[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Yes! Of course, I was born ready!
[color=red]The King Of Gnomes[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/king, next=10] that’s the spirit! My last task for you is to find my trophy I left at the end of the Hedge Maze, try not to get lost in there!
[color=#d950ff]Zed[/color]: [speed=0.3, voice=res://Gnome Level/Assets/Voicelines/, next=10] Can do! Be right back!
=> END 

